@TaskManagerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5188

### Criar tarefa
POST {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estudar arquitetura em camadas",
  "description": "Revisar Controllers, Services, Requests e Responses",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2030-12-31T18:00:00",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Listar tarefas
GET {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Buscar por ID
GET {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estudar arquitetura em camadas",
  "description": "Conteúdo revisado",
  "priority": "medium",
  "dueDate": "2030-12-31T20:00:00",
  "status": "inProgress"
}

### Excluir tarefa
DELETE {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
